<tr><td>Brodalumab（anti–IL-17RA）</td><td>AMAGINE-1 PASI75 at week 12：<strong class="ex-n">60%</strong>（140 mg）、<strong class="ex-n">83%</strong>（210 mg）vs <strong class="ex-n">3%</strong>；AMAGINE-2：86%（210 mg）／67%（140 mg）vs 8%；AMAGINE-3：85%（210 mg）／69%（140 mg）vs 6%。210 mg q2w 優於 ustekinumab；GPP <strong class="ex-n">11/12（92%）</strong>改善</td><td><strong class="ex-n">210 mg</strong> SC at weeks 0、1、2，之後 every 2 weeks</td><td><strong>Suicidal ideation</strong>、serious infections、TB、<mark data-q="110-05"><strong>Crohn disease</strong></mark>、arthralgia、headache、injection-site reactions、neutropenia</td></tr>
